<h1 class="ds-page-title">Mobile — No Hubs</h1>
<p class="ds-page-subtitle">
  Redesigned mental model: no hubs/workspaces, first-class channel types (public, private,
  session/bounded), threading in the sidebar, streaming as a core value. One installation = one team.
</p>

<!-- Knobs -->
<div class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section-title">Gesture knobs</h2>
  <p class="ds-section-desc">Adjust these to find the right feel, then copy values into <code>swipe-nav.js</code>.</p>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;align-items:flex-end;margin-bottom:4px">
    <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary)">
      Lock threshold (px) — how far before direction is decided
      <input id="knob-nh-lock" type="range" min="4" max="40" value="20" style="width:200px">
      <span id="knob-nh-lock-val" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent)">20</span>
    </label>
    <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary)">
      Commit threshold (% of panel width)
      <input id="knob-nh-commit" type="range" min="10" max="60" value="13" style="width:200px">
      <span id="knob-nh-commit-val" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent)">13%</span>
    </label>
    <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary)">
      Velocity threshold (px/ms) for fast flick
      <input id="knob-nh-vel" type="range" min="10" max="100" value="100" style="width:200px">
      <span id="knob-nh-vel-val" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent)">1.00</span>
    </label>
    <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary)">
      Rubber-band resistance (0 = rigid, 1 = none)
      <input id="knob-nh-rubber" type="range" min="0" max="90" value="0" style="width:200px">
      <span id="knob-nh-rubber-val" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent)">0.00</span>
    </label>
  </div>
</div>

